1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,260 --> 00:01:38,940
=Episode 35=

4
00:01:40,780 --> 00:01:43,020
(Ganlu Hall)

5
00:01:50,900 --> 00:01:51,260
Your Majesty.

6
00:01:52,100 --> 00:01:53,700
You look well today.

7
00:01:54,340 --> 00:01:55,140
Do you...

8
00:01:58,100 --> 00:01:58,540
Do you

9
00:01:58,780 --> 00:02:01,340
want your grandson for company?

10
00:02:07,140 --> 00:02:07,540
No.

11
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:11,620
Not today.

12
00:02:18,860 --> 00:02:20,100
Bring me the brush and ink.

13
00:02:22,380 --> 00:02:24,180
I'll dictate. You write.

14
00:02:26,540 --> 00:02:30,020
(Tranquility Brings Wisdom)

15
00:02:33,180 --> 00:02:35,500
I have borne our ancestors' burden

16
00:02:35,980 --> 00:02:38,860
for 41 years.

17
00:02:39,460 --> 00:02:39,980
(Imperial edict of succession!)

18
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:43,820
There has been much warfare,

19
00:02:44,620 --> 00:02:46,540
yet the realm has grown more peaceful.

20
00:02:48,340 --> 00:02:49,660
Floods and droughts persist,

21
00:02:50,180 --> 00:02:51,580
yet the granaries have not run empty.

22
00:02:53,220 --> 00:02:56,260
All this is thanks to my ministers' aid.

23
00:02:57,100 --> 00:02:58,540
How could my meager virtue

24
00:02:59,020 --> 00:03:00,260
have brought this about?

25
00:03:02,420 --> 00:03:03,660
Crown Prince Mu Xun...

26
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:07,700
(It's the Crown Prince!)

27
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:11,180
He is the legitimate heir,

28
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:13,340
blessed with Heaven-given wisdom.

29
00:03:20,740 --> 00:03:22,100
Why have you stopped writing?

30
00:03:23,260 --> 00:03:23,780
I...

31
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:25,260
I thought...

32
00:03:26,020 --> 00:03:26,700
Thought what?

33
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:31,940
You thought I'd name
the Prince of Jin heir?

34
00:03:37,060 --> 00:03:39,340
He's a spineless fool.

35
00:03:39,980 --> 00:03:42,260
He's better off living in comfort.

36
00:03:42,860 --> 00:03:43,740
This throne

37
00:03:44,420 --> 00:03:45,380
is beyond his ability.

38
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:50,180
I confined the Crown Prince
and cut off his allies

39
00:03:50,420 --> 00:03:51,180
because

40
00:03:52,420 --> 00:03:53,340
all of this

41
00:03:54,820 --> 00:03:56,740
can only be given to him by me.

42
00:03:57,220 --> 00:03:57,940
He himself

43
00:03:58,780 --> 00:04:00,620
must not entertain such ambitions.

44
00:04:02,780 --> 00:04:04,620
He is too calculating.

45
00:04:05,020 --> 00:04:07,940
He needs years of hard lessons.

46
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:08,860
It will be good for him

47
00:04:09,460 --> 00:04:11,100
and for Huai.

48
00:04:12,540 --> 00:04:14,660
He can't even handle Wanyao.

49
00:04:15,100 --> 00:04:15,620
How can I

50
00:04:16,380 --> 00:04:17,940
possibly feel at ease

51
00:04:18,300 --> 00:04:20,260
entrusting him with the empire?

52
00:04:23,660 --> 00:04:24,580
I understand.

53
00:04:25,260 --> 00:04:26,180
I'll continue writing.

54
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:31,340
(I mend my faults and grow cautious.
He shall ascend before my coffin.)

55
00:04:32,220 --> 00:04:33,100
(If Mu Xun succeeds to the throne,)

56
00:04:34,300 --> 00:04:35,140
(given his temperament,)

57
00:04:35,860 --> 00:04:37,300
(Prince of Jin, his own brother,)

58
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:39,100
(may not survive.)

59
00:04:41,100 --> 00:04:42,580
(Chunhua may also...)

60
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:49,420
(I mend my faults and grow cautious.
He shall ascend before my coffin.)

61
00:05:00,140 --> 00:05:02,980
(Follow Han Emperor Wen's funeral rites.
I entrust the realm to you.)

62
00:05:02,980 --> 00:05:03,580
Bring it here.

63
00:05:21,100 --> 00:05:22,700
(Follow Han Emperor Wen's funeral rites.
I entrust the realm to you.)

64
00:05:27,700 --> 00:05:28,540
Put it away.

65
00:05:33,740 --> 00:05:34,580
This must not be disclosed.

66
00:05:36,660 --> 00:05:37,140
Yes.

67
00:06:07,740 --> 00:06:08,540
(He's fine now.)

68
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:17,580
Miss?

69
00:06:18,180 --> 00:06:19,180
Why are you standing at the door?

70
00:06:28,220 --> 00:06:30,620
Sir, your fever was awful yesterday.

71
00:06:31,260 --> 00:06:33,300
Thankfully, it soon passed.

72
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:35,300
Perhaps the heavy rain all night

73
00:06:35,420 --> 00:06:36,660
washed away your illness too.

74
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:39,940
Perhaps.

75
00:06:40,860 --> 00:06:42,740
The clerk asked me to bring these over.

76
00:06:43,260 --> 00:06:44,460
But he said there's no rush.

77
00:06:44,940 --> 00:06:46,220
Wait until you've fully recovered.

78
00:06:47,780 --> 00:06:48,820
I'm well enough now.

79
00:06:49,500 --> 00:06:50,300
Read them to me.

80
00:06:54,340 --> 00:06:55,100
But

81
00:06:55,340 --> 00:06:57,900
Mr. Yang's maid brought medicine.

82
00:06:58,540 --> 00:06:59,740
Why don't you drink it first?

83
00:07:08,940 --> 00:07:09,340
All right.

84
00:07:10,860 --> 00:07:11,660
Thank you, Miss.

85
00:07:23,900 --> 00:07:25,980
Oh no. I brought the wrong things.

86
00:07:26,220 --> 00:07:27,020
This isn't the right pile.

87
00:07:27,540 --> 00:07:28,300
Sir, I'm sorry.

88
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:29,260
I'll be right back.

89
00:07:29,900 --> 00:07:31,980
Miss, please watch over him.

90
00:08:05,500 --> 00:08:07,180
Your Highness now bears the fate
of the realm.

91
00:08:08,740 --> 00:08:09,980
A small county like Lanyang

92
00:08:11,620 --> 00:08:12,900
isn't worth staying for so long.

93
00:08:44,620 --> 00:08:45,540
When did you find out?

94
00:08:48,580 --> 00:08:49,140
Was it that night?

95
00:08:50,460 --> 00:08:51,860
When I wrote on your palm?

96
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:53,300
That night,

97
00:08:54,540 --> 00:08:55,660
I was certain it was you.

98
00:08:57,340 --> 00:08:58,380
Before that, I only suspected.

99
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:00,380
Then why didn't you say so sooner?

100
00:09:06,140 --> 00:09:06,820
Why so silent?

101
00:09:09,220 --> 00:09:09,900
Scholar Yan,

102
00:09:11,060 --> 00:09:12,580
aren't you usually so eloquent?

103
00:09:29,620 --> 00:09:30,420
I thought

104
00:09:32,740 --> 00:09:33,980
we would never meet again.

105
00:09:39,980 --> 00:09:41,220
That you were still willing to see me

106
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:45,500
makes me very happy.

107
00:09:46,140 --> 00:09:46,940
Happy?

108
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:52,860
Happy that you fooled me once again,

109
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:55,460
or do you have some other motive?

110
00:09:57,420 --> 00:09:58,100
You knew

111
00:09:58,980 --> 00:09:59,860
once the truth came out,

112
00:10:01,380 --> 00:10:02,300
I would leave at once,

113
00:10:03,420 --> 00:10:03,740
didn't you?

114
00:10:07,180 --> 00:10:08,380
Back in Lingnan,

115
00:10:09,380 --> 00:10:10,820
you had me completely fooled

116
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:13,420
just to make me take you away.

117
00:10:15,820 --> 00:10:16,300
This time,

118
00:10:17,340 --> 00:10:18,060
what do you want?

119
00:10:19,940 --> 00:10:21,180
Now that you've lost your sight...

120
00:10:26,220 --> 00:10:27,380
Your blindness is what you deserve.

121
00:10:28,260 --> 00:10:28,980
I hope one day

122
00:10:29,860 --> 00:10:31,180
that wretched tongue of yours

123
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,380
will be of no use either.

124
00:10:44,420 --> 00:10:45,020
(Shendu Hall)
Then...

125
00:10:47,900 --> 00:10:48,980
When will you leave?

126
00:10:56,020 --> 00:10:56,540
Today.

127
00:11:25,820 --> 00:11:26,500
Prepare to depart.

128
00:11:28,660 --> 00:11:29,780
Must you rush so much?

129
00:11:44,820 --> 00:11:45,420
It's time to go.

130
00:11:46,340 --> 00:11:47,020
Is it because

131
00:11:47,500 --> 00:11:48,780
there's no reason to stay here anymore,

132
00:11:49,740 --> 00:11:50,420
or because

133
00:11:51,180 --> 00:11:52,620
Yan Shang finally knows who you are?

134
00:11:53,060 --> 00:11:53,700
You've overstepped!

135
00:11:58,180 --> 00:11:58,780
It's time to go.

136
00:12:01,260 --> 00:12:02,940
(While I can still be ruthless.)

137
00:12:21,740 --> 00:12:28,220
(County Office)

138
00:12:28,220 --> 00:12:28,780
Leaving already?

139
00:12:29,700 --> 00:12:30,380
Here, take this.

140
00:12:30,660 --> 00:12:31,340
I'll go help.

141
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:31,820
All right.

142
00:12:33,620 --> 00:12:35,660
Miss, sir,
are you friends of our magistrate?

143
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:37,620
Yes.

144
00:12:39,060 --> 00:12:40,740
Come back to Lanyang when you can

145
00:12:41,020 --> 00:12:42,300
and visit our magistrate.

146
00:12:44,140 --> 00:12:46,180
(County Office)

147
00:12:46,180 --> 00:12:47,060
The magistrate is here.

148
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:55,540
Magistrate Yan.

149
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:07,940
What are you doing here?

150
00:13:08,500 --> 00:13:13,380
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

151
00:13:13,700 --> 00:13:14,140
Farewell,

152
00:13:15,020 --> 00:13:16,980
Your Highnesses.

153
00:13:18,940 --> 00:13:19,500
There's no need.

154
00:13:20,140 --> 00:13:21,260
You weren't here to see me off anyway.

155
00:13:24,860 --> 00:13:25,220
Wanyao.

156
00:13:25,220 --> 00:13:29,100
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

157
00:13:29,220 --> 00:13:34,940
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪
(County Office)

158
00:13:38,780 --> 00:13:39,180
Yan Shang.

159
00:13:41,060 --> 00:13:42,420
In Huai, officials are chosen

160
00:13:44,420 --> 00:13:45,380
by looks, speech, calligraphy,
and judgment,

161
00:13:46,060 --> 00:13:46,860
with appearance ranked first.

162
00:13:48,100 --> 00:13:48,980
Since you are now blind,

163
00:13:50,140 --> 00:13:51,460
you should be removed as magistrate.

164
00:13:53,380 --> 00:13:54,380
But your record is commendable.

165
00:13:56,060 --> 00:13:57,980
I can make an exception for you.

166
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:01,740
Thank you for your grace, Your Highness.

167
00:14:01,740 --> 00:14:04,500
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪
(County Office)

168
00:14:04,780 --> 00:14:09,220
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

169
00:14:09,220 --> 00:14:10,020
Go back to your duties.

170
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:11,420
♪Not a single hour less♪

171
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:12,460
In a few days,

172
00:14:13,660 --> 00:14:14,500
I'll send an imperial physician.

173
00:14:15,060 --> 00:14:15,820
There's no need, Your Highness.

174
00:14:16,100 --> 00:14:17,380
How dare you refuse me?

175
00:14:19,220 --> 00:14:22,660
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

176
00:14:22,820 --> 00:14:25,380
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

177
00:14:25,380 --> 00:14:26,020
I wouldn't dare.

178
00:14:27,100 --> 00:14:27,620
It's just that

179
00:14:28,460 --> 00:14:29,940
Wenji sent imperial physicians
several times.

180
00:14:31,260 --> 00:14:31,860
It's no use.

181
00:14:32,180 --> 00:14:33,180
The ones he found didn't work.

182
00:14:33,860 --> 00:14:35,300
I may yet find someone
who can treat you!

183
00:14:35,460 --> 00:14:38,100
♪- Dusk lights fade, flowers bloom;
- May time be free of pain♪

184
00:14:38,580 --> 00:14:39,060
What are you laughing at?

185
00:14:39,060 --> 00:14:40,700
♪You're the only one I need♪

186
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:41,820
I'm laughing at myself.

187
00:14:43,140 --> 00:14:45,500
Your Highness stayed silent for days,

188
00:14:46,420 --> 00:14:46,980
and the moment you spoke,

189
00:14:48,060 --> 00:14:48,980
all you did was scold me.

190
00:14:49,220 --> 00:14:49,860
You deserve it!

191
00:14:49,860 --> 00:14:51,340
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

192
00:14:51,380 --> 00:14:54,820
♪My last untouched innocence♪

193
00:15:00,180 --> 00:15:00,980
When we parted that day,

194
00:15:02,300 --> 00:15:04,780
I never dared hope we would meet again.

195
00:15:06,260 --> 00:15:06,700
And yet,

196
00:15:08,020 --> 00:15:08,700
in this life,

197
00:15:10,020 --> 00:15:10,980
we must part once more.

198
00:15:13,220 --> 00:15:15,060
A long road lies ahead.

199
00:15:15,700 --> 00:15:16,700
We may never meet again.

200
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:20,580
I only wish you

201
00:15:21,820 --> 00:15:22,980
health and peace, year after year,

202
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:24,980
and a long, blessed life.

203
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:32,780
♪- Burning bright as a song;
- See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

204
00:15:32,900 --> 00:15:37,780
♪Be the vow I whisper again and again♪

205
00:15:37,860 --> 00:15:42,660
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

206
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:44,540
♪Not a single hour less♪

207
00:15:44,580 --> 00:15:48,360
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

208
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:52,340
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

209
00:15:52,420 --> 00:15:55,780
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

210
00:15:56,060 --> 00:15:59,420
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

211
00:15:59,620 --> 00:16:06,500
♪If we're lucky to stay in this world,
let's return to when we first met♪

212
00:16:06,700 --> 00:16:08,580
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

213
00:16:08,580 --> 00:16:11,220
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

214
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:13,780
♪You're the only one I need♪

215
00:16:13,860 --> 00:16:17,520
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

216
00:16:17,520 --> 00:16:21,020
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

217
00:16:21,100 --> 00:16:24,420
♪- Be my one and only in this world;
- Be my one and only in this life♪

218
00:16:24,580 --> 00:16:27,940
♪My last untouched innocence♪

219
00:16:28,260 --> 00:16:31,700
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

220
00:16:31,980 --> 00:16:35,340
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

221
00:16:35,500 --> 00:16:42,380
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

222
00:16:42,580 --> 00:16:44,460
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

223
00:16:44,460 --> 00:16:47,100
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

224
00:16:47,220 --> 00:16:49,780
♪You're the only one I need♪

225
00:16:49,820 --> 00:16:52,580
♪By your side, through joy and pain♪

226
00:16:52,580 --> 00:16:56,980
♪Is that eternity?♪
(Chengfu Gate)

227
00:16:57,060 --> 00:17:00,420
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

228
00:17:00,460 --> 00:17:03,900
♪The wind blows past us♪

229
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:08,780
♪- If there's still;
- Some warmth left in this world♪

230
00:17:09,540 --> 00:17:14,020
♪You're the only one I need♪

231
00:17:16,380 --> 00:17:16,900
Yang Si.

232
00:17:19,740 --> 00:17:21,380
Thanks for staying these past few days.

233
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:25,100
No need to thank me.

234
00:17:25,820 --> 00:17:26,580
It wasn't exactly my pleasure.

235
00:17:30,820 --> 00:17:32,100
Then thank you for your patience.

236
00:17:38,060 --> 00:17:38,500
Forget it.

237
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:41,820
He was fine before. Look at him now.

238
00:17:43,060 --> 00:17:43,820
Anyone would feel sorry for him...

239
00:17:46,020 --> 00:17:47,140
Why should I hold it against him?

240
00:17:55,900 --> 00:17:57,320
(I'm ignorant and know little,
yet I've studied how rulers govern.)

241
00:17:57,320 --> 00:17:58,620
(The principles are all laid out.
None in history rivals your foresight.)

242
00:18:18,860 --> 00:18:20,890
(Thus, humbly, I offer my limited
thoughts and observations.)

243
00:18:20,890 --> 00:18:22,780
(Though unworthy of Your Majesty's
grace, I submit what may be of value.)

244
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:31,300
Once we're back in Sheng'an,

245
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:33,620
we'll seek a renowned eye doctor.

246
00:18:34,220 --> 00:18:35,100
There may yet be a way.

247
00:19:14,140 --> 00:19:14,620
Easy.

248
00:19:15,180 --> 00:19:15,900
Don't splash them.

249
00:19:16,260 --> 00:19:16,620
Yes.

250
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:31,460
Mother!

251
00:19:31,820 --> 00:19:32,220
Mother!

252
00:19:32,620 --> 00:19:33,020
Mother!

253
00:19:33,940 --> 00:19:34,420
Stop the carriage!

254
00:19:40,900 --> 00:19:41,340
Doctor!

255
00:19:41,740 --> 00:19:42,060
Quick!

256
00:19:42,540 --> 00:19:42,940
Doctor!

257
00:19:43,620 --> 00:19:43,900
Here!

258
00:19:44,220 --> 00:19:44,660
Lay her down here.

259
00:19:50,020 --> 00:19:50,500
Mother.

260
00:20:11,300 --> 00:20:11,940
Thank you, Doctor!

261
00:20:12,260 --> 00:20:12,980
Thank you, Doctor!

262
00:20:13,260 --> 00:20:13,980
- Please, get up.
- Thank you.

263
00:20:14,100 --> 00:20:15,060
A miracle worker!

264
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:20,300
Mother.

265
00:20:21,340 --> 00:20:21,700
Mother.

266
00:20:26,500 --> 00:20:27,380
Sir, may I ask

267
00:20:28,340 --> 00:20:29,940
what this elderly woman's illness is?

268
00:20:30,460 --> 00:20:31,180
It's not an illness.

269
00:20:31,700 --> 00:20:32,900
The weather has been
suddenly hot and cold lately.

270
00:20:33,380 --> 00:20:34,540
She was likely caught in the rain

271
00:20:34,780 --> 00:20:35,660
and has overexerted herself.

272
00:20:36,060 --> 00:20:36,780
Her breath has become disordered,

273
00:20:37,300 --> 00:20:38,740
and Yin and Yang no longer harmonize.

274
00:20:39,020 --> 00:20:40,060
That's what caused her fainting spell.

275
00:20:40,700 --> 00:20:41,580
Lately,

276
00:20:42,260 --> 00:20:43,660
I've seen many patients like this.

277
00:20:44,460 --> 00:20:44,740
Yes.

278
00:20:44,900 --> 00:20:45,180
That's right.

279
00:20:46,060 --> 00:20:46,820
She was indeed caught in the rain.

280
00:20:47,660 --> 00:20:48,180
Thank you, Doctor.

281
00:20:48,500 --> 00:20:49,060
There's no need to worry.

282
00:20:49,460 --> 00:20:50,540
She just needs to rest at home.

283
00:20:51,020 --> 00:20:51,300
All right.

284
00:20:51,620 --> 00:20:52,140
Dear!

285
00:20:53,420 --> 00:20:55,140
Our stored herbs are nearly gone.

286
00:20:56,540 --> 00:20:59,460
Let's buy more herbs in town soon.

287
00:21:00,220 --> 00:21:00,820
Get some rest.

288
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:01,660
I'll go tomorrow.

289
00:21:06,860 --> 00:21:07,980
You heal the sick, give out medicine,

290
00:21:08,740 --> 00:21:09,620
and help the poor.

291
00:21:09,620 --> 00:21:10,300
That's truly admirable.

292
00:21:11,140 --> 00:21:12,020
May I ask your names?

293
00:21:12,220 --> 00:21:12,620
You're too kind.

294
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:13,900
(Lin Dao, son of Prefect Lin Chuan;
Liu Ruozhu, Chancellor Liu's daughter)

295
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:14,540
I'm Lin Dao.

296
00:21:15,620 --> 00:21:16,220
My wife is surnamed Liu.

297
00:21:18,700 --> 00:21:19,220
Lin Dao?

298
00:21:21,100 --> 00:21:22,940
Is Yuezhou Prefect Lin Chuan
your father?

299
00:21:23,220 --> 00:21:23,660
Yes.

300
00:21:24,620 --> 00:21:25,580
How did you know, Miss?

301
00:21:27,900 --> 00:21:28,700
This lady

302
00:21:29,140 --> 00:21:30,300
must be Chancellor Liu's daughter.

303
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:39,060
I failed to recognize Your Highness.

304
00:21:39,620 --> 00:21:40,340
I was discourteous just now.

305
00:21:41,620 --> 00:21:42,740
Her Highness is traveling incognito.

306
00:21:43,340 --> 00:21:44,740
Please don't reveal her identity, sir.

307
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:46,060
Please, sit.

308
00:21:46,820 --> 00:21:47,260
I understand.

309
00:21:47,820 --> 00:21:48,540
Rest assured.

310
00:21:49,740 --> 00:21:50,020
Sit.

311
00:21:54,900 --> 00:21:56,140
I've heard that Chancellor Liu

312
00:21:56,580 --> 00:21:57,700
considered Sheng'an's finest young men.

313
00:21:58,300 --> 00:22:00,900
In the end, Ms. Liu chose Mr. Lin

314
00:22:01,340 --> 00:22:02,180
as her husband.

315
00:22:03,180 --> 00:22:03,980
Seeing you today,

316
00:22:04,500 --> 00:22:05,380
I can say Chancellor Liu chose well.

317
00:22:06,300 --> 00:22:07,340
I'm fortunate that my wife accepted me.

318
00:22:08,420 --> 00:22:10,580
The Lin family has many officials,

319
00:22:11,460 --> 00:22:13,380
and their Tianshui Library
holds many books,

320
00:22:13,660 --> 00:22:14,500
making it renowned among scholars.

321
00:22:15,100 --> 00:22:16,780
You, too, are known for your talent.

322
00:22:17,740 --> 00:22:19,980
Why not take the exams and serve?

323
00:22:20,460 --> 00:22:21,340
Life is brief,

324
00:22:21,540 --> 00:22:22,340
and everyone has their own aspirations.

325
00:22:23,220 --> 00:22:24,340
The Lin clan has many sons.

326
00:22:24,780 --> 00:22:25,860
It doesn't need me
to enter civil service.

327
00:22:26,420 --> 00:22:28,060
Your Highness is promoting the exams.

328
00:22:28,420 --> 00:22:30,700
Scholars abound across the realm.

329
00:22:31,260 --> 00:22:31,700
Huai

330
00:22:32,220 --> 00:22:33,780
has enough scholars already.

331
00:22:34,780 --> 00:22:36,860
I've never met a noble-born man

332
00:22:37,500 --> 00:22:38,460
whose ambition was to practice medicine.

333
00:22:40,580 --> 00:22:41,260
To be honest, Your Highness,

334
00:22:42,460 --> 00:22:43,740
I loved reading as a child,

335
00:22:44,220 --> 00:22:45,620
but I mostly read history and classics.

336
00:22:45,740 --> 00:22:46,500
I paid little heed to worldly affairs.

337
00:22:47,100 --> 00:22:47,620
Later,

338
00:22:48,300 --> 00:22:49,500
I traveled far and wide with my books.

339
00:22:50,100 --> 00:22:52,340
I saw what happened to local families.

340
00:22:53,100 --> 00:22:54,660
If one falls seriously ill,

341
00:22:56,220 --> 00:22:57,540
the family often spend all they have,

342
00:22:57,780 --> 00:22:59,060
yet still lose their loved one.

343
00:22:59,620 --> 00:23:00,380
That's when I realized

344
00:23:01,020 --> 00:23:01,900
though a physician holds a humble rank,

345
00:23:02,500 --> 00:23:03,340
they can save lives.

346
00:23:03,980 --> 00:23:05,420
Our home has thousands of books,

347
00:23:05,780 --> 00:23:07,100
but only the healing arts

348
00:23:07,660 --> 00:23:09,340
can ease the people's suffering.

349
00:23:13,140 --> 00:23:14,380
You are fortunate to have a wife

350
00:23:14,660 --> 00:23:16,380
who'll travel with you through hardship,
treating patients wherever you go.

351
00:23:17,340 --> 00:23:18,300
Is that

352
00:23:18,780 --> 00:23:19,940
your passion too, Ms. Liu?

353
00:23:20,780 --> 00:23:21,860
I enjoy collecting old books,

354
00:23:22,460 --> 00:23:24,380
especially books on music and Go.

355
00:23:25,340 --> 00:23:26,260
I travel with my husband,

356
00:23:26,860 --> 00:23:27,740
helping him treat patients,

357
00:23:28,260 --> 00:23:29,580
and he searches for old books for me

358
00:23:30,260 --> 00:23:31,100
without sparing himself any effort.

359
00:23:31,940 --> 00:23:32,980
Unfortunately,

360
00:23:33,620 --> 00:23:34,620
I cannot see.

361
00:23:35,460 --> 00:23:36,500
Otherwise, along the way,

362
00:23:37,180 --> 00:23:38,700
I could help you with so much more.

363
00:23:39,380 --> 00:23:40,420
Ms. Liu, your eyes...

364
00:23:42,540 --> 00:23:43,580
With Lin Dao's medical skills,

365
00:23:44,380 --> 00:23:45,380
there's still nothing he can do?

366
00:23:47,300 --> 00:23:48,420
He's done all he can.

367
00:23:49,460 --> 00:23:52,260
But I've been this way since birth.

368
00:23:53,180 --> 00:23:54,900
My father sought renowned physicians

369
00:23:55,220 --> 00:23:56,100
but nothing helped.

370
00:23:56,660 --> 00:23:57,260
My husband

371
00:23:57,900 --> 00:23:59,660
had read every medical book
in Tianshui Library.

372
00:24:00,580 --> 00:24:02,660
We've traveled far and wide,

373
00:24:03,220 --> 00:24:04,660
seeking remedies across the land.

374
00:24:05,420 --> 00:24:06,100
Sadly,

375
00:24:07,060 --> 00:24:08,140
none has worked.

376
00:24:09,180 --> 00:24:10,220
This congenital blindness

377
00:24:12,060 --> 00:24:13,500
is indeed beyond the reach of medicine.

378
00:24:18,700 --> 00:24:19,260
Last year,

379
00:24:20,180 --> 00:24:20,900
while staying in the Shu region,

380
00:24:22,220 --> 00:24:24,260
I treated two patients
who had been blind for a long time.

381
00:24:25,260 --> 00:24:27,460
They regained their sight
after acupuncture.

382
00:24:28,940 --> 00:24:29,460
Unfortunately,

383
00:24:31,220 --> 00:24:33,900
the same technique did not suit my wife.

384
00:24:35,300 --> 00:24:36,980
I only made you suffer needlessly.

385
00:24:37,300 --> 00:24:38,060
Don't worry.

386
00:24:41,460 --> 00:24:42,060
Mr. Lin,

387
00:24:44,180 --> 00:24:45,060
I'd like you

388
00:24:45,820 --> 00:24:46,660
to see a patient.

389
00:24:55,340 --> 00:24:55,780
Coming.

390
00:25:12,860 --> 00:25:13,500
Who's outside?

391
00:25:15,220 --> 00:25:16,140
Your eyes can't see,

392
00:25:16,620 --> 00:25:17,500
yet you'll open the door to anyone?

393
00:25:18,260 --> 00:25:19,540
Have you no sense of caution?

394
00:25:21,780 --> 00:25:22,700
Donglang was fast asleep.

395
00:25:25,060 --> 00:25:25,540
Why are you...

396
00:25:35,780 --> 00:25:39,460
(Shendu Hall)

397
00:25:39,460 --> 00:25:40,380
From what I can tell,

398
00:25:41,500 --> 00:25:43,260
his blindness is from poison.

399
00:25:43,460 --> 00:25:44,300
It blocks the eye channels.

400
00:25:45,140 --> 00:25:46,740
First, needle the point,

401
00:25:47,220 --> 00:25:49,060
then shield his eyes with healing gauze.

402
00:25:49,740 --> 00:25:51,500
His sight may return. There's hope.

403
00:25:52,580 --> 00:25:53,740
But this method of acupuncture

404
00:25:56,220 --> 00:25:57,420
may cause him some pain.

405
00:25:58,140 --> 00:25:59,180
What are the chances of success?

406
00:26:02,940 --> 00:26:03,420
Thirty percent.

407
00:26:05,260 --> 00:26:07,060
Even ten percent would be worth trying.

408
00:26:08,580 --> 00:26:08,900
Please.

409
00:26:12,740 --> 00:26:13,980
Your Highness decided for me

410
00:26:14,660 --> 00:26:15,900
as if these were your own eyes.

411
00:26:16,100 --> 00:26:16,620
They are mine!

412
00:26:17,220 --> 00:26:18,460
Even your life is mine! Remember that!

413
00:26:25,260 --> 00:26:29,500
(Shendu Hall)

414
00:26:53,980 --> 00:26:54,540
Dr. Lin.

415
00:27:04,340 --> 00:27:04,780
Yan Shang!

416
00:27:11,220 --> 00:27:11,820
It's all right.

417
00:27:12,980 --> 00:27:13,460
That's it.

418
00:27:23,020 --> 00:27:23,780
How do you feel?

419
00:27:33,980 --> 00:27:35,020
Can't you see even a glimmer?

420
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:37,220
No.

421
00:27:44,180 --> 00:27:44,660
I'm sorry.

422
00:27:45,260 --> 00:27:46,100
It seems this treatment

423
00:27:47,740 --> 00:27:48,780
isn't right for you either.

424
00:27:51,980 --> 00:27:52,460
Don't take it off.

425
00:27:54,860 --> 00:27:55,340
Your Highness.

426
00:28:01,060 --> 00:28:01,900
Thank you for your efforts, Dr. Lin.

427
00:28:02,980 --> 00:28:03,780
I appreciate

428
00:28:04,740 --> 00:28:05,660
your kindness.

429
00:28:06,460 --> 00:28:07,500
I'll keep searching.

430
00:28:08,420 --> 00:28:09,620
I believe there's a cure.

431
00:28:11,140 --> 00:28:11,620
Mr. Yan,

432
00:28:12,300 --> 00:28:13,100
sorry to disturb you so late.

433
00:28:14,340 --> 00:28:14,780
We'll take our leave.

434
00:28:15,140 --> 00:28:15,580
(Shendu Hall)
Wait.

435
00:28:16,380 --> 00:28:17,460
Dr. Lin, you've traveled for days.

436
00:28:18,340 --> 00:28:19,060
Why not

437
00:28:19,500 --> 00:28:20,500
stay here tonight with your wife?

438
00:29:04,340 --> 00:29:05,140
Why don't you light the lamp?

439
00:29:06,100 --> 00:29:07,060
The lamp oil

440
00:29:07,740 --> 00:29:09,180
is where I can save.

441
00:29:09,540 --> 00:29:10,220
But I don't like this!

442
00:29:31,140 --> 00:29:32,180
I hate seeing you

443
00:29:33,660 --> 00:29:35,220
grope through life in the dark.

444
00:29:37,980 --> 00:29:38,460
Your Highness.

445
00:29:39,700 --> 00:29:41,180
I've grown used to it.

446
00:29:42,220 --> 00:29:43,100
In my daily life,

447
00:29:43,860 --> 00:29:44,900
it causes me little trouble.

448
00:29:45,580 --> 00:29:47,300
Not a word you say pleases me.

449
00:29:48,500 --> 00:29:50,300
Not like when you wooed me, Yan Shang.

450
00:29:52,980 --> 00:29:54,060
If that's all you have to say,

451
00:29:54,460 --> 00:29:55,100
then don't say it.

452
00:29:57,820 --> 00:29:59,140
I was doing it on purpose, actually.

453
00:30:03,060 --> 00:30:04,140
I let the brush slip on purpose.

454
00:30:12,140 --> 00:30:12,820
The truth is,

455
00:30:14,260 --> 00:30:15,900
I knew you shouldn't come back.

456
00:30:17,140 --> 00:30:18,140
But you did.

457
00:30:19,580 --> 00:30:20,940
And I'm overjoyed.

458
00:30:23,100 --> 00:30:24,260
When I woke this morning,

459
00:30:25,660 --> 00:30:26,540
your hair

460
00:30:27,460 --> 00:30:28,500
brushed against my face.

461
00:30:30,220 --> 00:30:31,460
I was filled with joy.

462
00:30:38,220 --> 00:30:38,940
The truth is...

463
00:30:41,580 --> 00:30:42,460
I'm scared.

464
00:30:43,660 --> 00:30:44,580
Because even in my dreams,

465
00:30:45,900 --> 00:30:46,540
your face

466
00:30:48,260 --> 00:30:49,540
is starting to fade.

467
00:30:51,460 --> 00:30:52,060
If...

468
00:30:53,660 --> 00:30:54,780
I could see you once more,

469
00:30:56,740 --> 00:30:57,820
I'd remember it all.

470
00:30:58,980 --> 00:31:00,380
Every detail of your face.

471
00:31:02,100 --> 00:31:02,620
If...

472
00:32:15,580 --> 00:32:17,300
If only I'd met Lin Dao sooner,

473
00:32:18,260 --> 00:32:18,860
that would've been better.

474
00:32:22,060 --> 00:32:23,940
He may not have cured your eyes,

475
00:32:24,980 --> 00:32:26,220
but he cured your tongue.

476
00:32:49,140 --> 00:32:54,860
(County Office)

477
00:32:55,420 --> 00:32:55,820
Mr. Yan.

478
00:32:56,540 --> 00:32:56,940
We'll take our leave.

479
00:32:59,740 --> 00:33:00,980
Dr. Lin, Ms. Liu,

480
00:33:01,780 --> 00:33:03,180
if you ever pass through Lanyang again,

481
00:33:03,620 --> 00:33:05,220
please do visit my home.

482
00:33:08,220 --> 00:33:09,420
Thank you for the kind invitation.

483
00:33:09,940 --> 00:33:10,700
But

484
00:33:10,980 --> 00:33:13,460
we'll visit an old friend in Youzhou,

485
00:33:14,060 --> 00:33:16,620
then head south to seek ancient books

486
00:33:16,820 --> 00:33:17,660
and treat patients along the way.

487
00:33:18,700 --> 00:33:19,100
Yes.

488
00:33:19,700 --> 00:33:20,980
We don't know when we'll return.

489
00:33:23,300 --> 00:33:24,820
To have each other wherever you roam,

490
00:33:26,060 --> 00:33:27,100
you needn't envy any other couple.

491
00:33:28,580 --> 00:33:29,540
Your Highness
and the Prince Consort, too...

492
00:33:38,100 --> 00:33:39,700
Your Highness, gentlemen,

493
00:33:40,660 --> 00:33:41,580
until we meet again.

494
00:33:43,980 --> 00:33:45,140
Until we meet again.

495
00:33:45,140 --> 00:33:46,100
(County Office)

496
00:33:46,100 --> 00:33:46,460
Dear.

497
00:33:47,140 --> 00:33:47,500
Let's go.

498
00:33:57,140 --> 00:34:00,460
(Chengfu Gate)

499
00:34:00,460 --> 00:34:04,180
(County Office)

500
00:34:04,180 --> 00:34:05,540
You've gone to great trouble for me.

501
00:34:05,820 --> 00:34:06,860
I have no way to repay you.

502
00:34:08,100 --> 00:34:11,140
The Ghost Festival is on in town today.

503
00:34:11,500 --> 00:34:11,860
I wonder if you two...

504
00:34:11,860 --> 00:34:12,420
I'll pass.

505
00:34:13,740 --> 00:34:15,020
Where's a good tavern in Lanyang?

506
00:34:15,460 --> 00:34:16,060
I'd like a drink or two.

507
00:34:17,540 --> 00:34:18,060
Yang Si.

508
00:34:18,260 --> 00:34:18,620
What?

509
00:34:19,220 --> 00:34:21,260
Do you want to drink me under the table?

510
00:34:24,660 --> 00:34:24,980
Donglang.

511
00:34:25,180 --> 00:34:26,220
He can't drink.

512
00:34:26,540 --> 00:34:27,540
I'll take you to a good tavern.

513
00:34:28,100 --> 00:34:28,420
Come on.

514
00:34:28,980 --> 00:34:29,340
Let's go.

515
00:34:30,060 --> 00:34:30,340
Go.

516
00:34:30,340 --> 00:34:32,380
(County Office)

517
00:34:35,140 --> 00:34:35,700
Go on.

518
00:34:36,500 --> 00:34:37,420
What about the Ghost Festival?

519
00:34:38,500 --> 00:34:39,460
The Ghost Festival in Lanyang...

520
00:34:41,620 --> 00:34:42,060
Are you okay?

521
00:34:50,740 --> 00:34:51,460
There's nothing serious.

522
00:34:52,300 --> 00:34:54,300
I just had a sudden headache.

523
00:34:54,820 --> 00:34:55,460
It's gone now.

524
00:34:58,300 --> 00:35:00,020
Did Dr. Lin botch the treatment?

525
00:35:02,580 --> 00:35:04,220
We should have kept him here longer,

526
00:35:05,300 --> 00:35:06,500
so he could try a few more methods

527
00:35:07,060 --> 00:35:07,780
and put you through more suffering.

528
00:35:11,020 --> 00:35:13,020
Then I'll go bring him back.

529
00:35:14,060 --> 00:35:14,660
Come back.

530
00:35:16,020 --> 00:35:18,060
Drive evil spirits away! Light the way!

531
00:35:18,900 --> 00:35:22,420
Come see our latest scented sachets!

532
00:35:30,060 --> 00:35:31,820
Sugar figurines! Come buy!

533
00:35:32,700 --> 00:35:33,860
Sugar figurines!

534
00:35:43,420 --> 00:35:43,860
Magistrate Yan!

535
00:35:43,860 --> 00:35:44,700
Come again if you like them!

536
00:35:45,500 --> 00:35:46,300
I'll take these two.

537
00:35:46,300 --> 00:35:47,580
Scented sachets!

538
00:35:48,580 --> 00:35:50,660
Freshly made sachets! Have a look!

539
00:35:50,660 --> 00:35:52,420
Magistrate Yan, out for the festival?

540
00:35:52,940 --> 00:35:53,620
Magistrate Yan.

541
00:35:54,140 --> 00:35:55,740
Who's this lady beside you?

542
00:35:55,820 --> 00:35:56,820
She's quite beautiful!

543
00:35:58,620 --> 00:36:00,260
Here, take this lantern.

544
00:36:05,060 --> 00:36:05,460
Thank you.

545
00:36:06,460 --> 00:36:06,860
Thank you.

546
00:36:07,820 --> 00:36:08,100
Let's go.

547
00:36:08,140 --> 00:36:08,460
Come on.

548
00:36:11,580 --> 00:36:14,780
Drive evil spirits away! Light the way!

549
00:36:14,820 --> 00:36:15,700
On your right,

550
00:36:16,020 --> 00:36:18,740
there are little potted fruit trees.

551
00:36:19,540 --> 00:36:22,100
They're made of bamboo strips
and colored paper.

552
00:36:23,020 --> 00:36:24,580
Lanterns made from mugwort stalks!

553
00:36:28,700 --> 00:36:29,380
It's a shadow-puppet show.

554
00:36:31,620 --> 00:36:32,060
Yes.

555
00:36:32,340 --> 00:36:32,740
Hit him!

556
00:36:33,060 --> 00:36:33,860
Well done!

557
00:36:33,860 --> 00:36:34,300
Wonderful!

558
00:36:34,580 --> 00:36:34,980
Wonderful!

559
00:36:34,980 --> 00:36:36,060
We never tire of watching this!

560
00:36:40,100 --> 00:36:41,540
Lanyang's lanterns are fascinating.

561
00:36:42,460 --> 00:36:43,740
I've never seen these in Sheng'an.

562
00:36:45,220 --> 00:36:46,140
What do they look like?

563
00:36:47,740 --> 00:36:48,620
Like stars,

564
00:36:49,140 --> 00:36:49,980
twinkling in the night.

565
00:36:51,260 --> 00:36:52,180
They must be beautiful.

566
00:36:57,300 --> 00:36:58,140
It's lively up ahead.

567
00:36:58,900 --> 00:37:00,140
A rite for wandering spirits, it seems.

568
00:37:01,420 --> 00:37:01,980
Let's go take a look.

569
00:37:09,620 --> 00:37:10,380
Beautiful!

570
00:37:10,820 --> 00:37:11,860
It's so beautiful!

571
00:37:13,460 --> 00:37:14,300
(Chengfu Gate)
Wonderful!

572
00:37:15,380 --> 00:37:15,900
One more!

573
00:37:16,300 --> 00:37:17,420
Wonderful!

574
00:37:18,740 --> 00:37:19,300
Beautiful!

575
00:37:19,300 --> 00:37:20,380
One more!

576
00:37:21,220 --> 00:37:22,780
One more!

577
00:37:23,260 --> 00:37:23,860
Beautiful!

578
00:37:26,260 --> 00:37:27,580
Wonderful!

579
00:37:28,340 --> 00:37:29,180
One more!

580
00:37:29,380 --> 00:37:30,140
Another one!

581
00:37:30,540 --> 00:37:31,500
That's gorgeous!

582
00:37:32,700 --> 00:37:36,540
Wonderful! Wonderful!

583
00:37:37,500 --> 00:37:38,140
So beautiful!

584
00:37:41,260 --> 00:37:42,020
One more!

585
00:37:44,900 --> 00:37:45,620
This is fascinating.

586
00:37:46,500 --> 00:37:47,500
The living share a lively celebration,

587
00:37:48,300 --> 00:37:49,740
yet it's all to comfort the departed

588
00:37:50,100 --> 00:37:50,940
and guide the spirits to rest.

589
00:37:52,140 --> 00:37:52,540
Yan Shang.

590
00:37:53,300 --> 00:37:54,620
Have you thought about life and death?

591
00:37:56,260 --> 00:37:57,300
I did when I was young.

592
00:37:57,860 --> 00:37:59,700
I hoped my loved ones watched over me,

593
00:38:00,180 --> 00:38:01,420
yet feared they might never find peace.

594
00:38:02,780 --> 00:38:03,660
I no longer think about it.

595
00:38:04,380 --> 00:38:05,500
Life lasts no more than 30,000 days.

596
00:38:06,300 --> 00:38:08,380
We start naive, end frail and confused,

597
00:38:08,980 --> 00:38:09,940
and face danger, worry, and illness.

598
00:38:11,100 --> 00:38:12,140
The time we have to accomplish anything

599
00:38:12,620 --> 00:38:13,620
amounts to only a few decades.

600
00:38:14,620 --> 00:38:15,220
Every day we live

601
00:38:15,860 --> 00:38:16,940
must be spent on something worthwhile.

602
00:38:17,620 --> 00:38:18,660
Doesn't living like that wear you out?

603
00:38:19,900 --> 00:38:20,780
The world is but a waystation,

604
00:38:21,060 --> 00:38:21,860
and all things share one home.

605
00:38:22,740 --> 00:38:24,420
In the end, everything turns to dust.

606
00:38:25,420 --> 00:38:27,580
So we should live freely and fully
while we can

607
00:38:28,540 --> 00:38:29,300
and achieve what we set our minds to.

608
00:38:30,020 --> 00:38:30,620
Once we're dead,

609
00:38:31,060 --> 00:38:32,180
there'll be no chance to do anything.

610
00:38:33,140 --> 00:38:34,180
What is it Your Highness wants?

611
00:38:34,980 --> 00:38:35,900
There is much I want.

612
00:38:36,620 --> 00:38:37,660
So no matter what,

613
00:38:37,940 --> 00:38:39,020
I must live well

614
00:38:39,580 --> 00:38:40,500
and pursue all that I seek.

615
00:38:43,660 --> 00:38:44,580
Then I wish Your Highness

616
00:38:45,380 --> 00:38:46,340
every success.

617
00:38:47,500 --> 00:38:49,580
Then I thank you for those kind words.

618
00:38:54,980 --> 00:38:55,540
Who is she?

619
00:38:55,660 --> 00:38:56,020
Who is it?

620
00:38:56,020 --> 00:38:56,340
Who?

621
00:38:56,700 --> 00:38:57,060
Who is it?

622
00:38:57,180 --> 00:38:57,740
Who is she?

623
00:38:58,380 --> 00:38:58,980
Magistrate Yan,

624
00:38:59,700 --> 00:39:01,780
we should find somewhere quieter to sit.

625
00:39:02,700 --> 00:39:04,020
If we keep drawing this much attention,

626
00:39:04,420 --> 00:39:04,940
I'm afraid

627
00:39:05,700 --> 00:39:06,740
it could ruin your reputation.

628
00:39:08,580 --> 00:39:09,820
As Your Highness wishes.

629
00:39:21,660 --> 00:39:28,560
(Chengfu Gate)

630
00:39:58,220 --> 00:39:59,180
When are you going back?

631
00:40:06,460 --> 00:40:07,580
Would you like to hear the truth

632
00:40:08,620 --> 00:40:09,380
or a lie?

633
00:40:12,900 --> 00:40:13,420
The truth.

634
00:40:14,860 --> 00:40:15,740
Princess Danyang

635
00:40:16,860 --> 00:40:17,740
has no need to lie.

636
00:40:19,340 --> 00:40:19,860
Tomorrow.

637
00:40:27,500 --> 00:40:33,380
(Chengfu Gate)

638
00:40:35,820 --> 00:40:36,180
All right.

639
00:40:38,180 --> 00:40:38,820
I'll see you off.

640
00:40:45,420 --> 00:40:46,300
I also have a lie.

641
00:40:46,940 --> 00:40:47,540
Would you like to hear it?

642
00:40:50,420 --> 00:40:50,820
All right.

643
00:40:53,100 --> 00:40:53,900
I'm not going back.

644
00:40:55,820 --> 00:40:56,980
Every day from now on,

645
00:40:57,620 --> 00:40:58,260
and every night,

646
00:40:59,940 --> 00:41:01,180
we'll stay just as we are now.

647
00:41:02,740 --> 00:41:03,740
Together,

648
00:41:05,020 --> 00:41:06,140
hand in hand,

649
00:41:07,060 --> 00:41:08,420
sharing the ordinary chores of life.

650
00:41:09,700 --> 00:41:10,380
And in the end,

651
00:41:11,020 --> 00:41:12,460
we'll grow old and become

652
00:41:13,380 --> 00:41:14,340
a couple with grey hair.

653
00:41:21,580 --> 00:41:21,980
All right.

654
00:41:25,260 --> 00:41:26,620
Tonight, is it that whatever I say,

655
00:41:27,340 --> 00:41:28,100
you'll agree with me?

656
00:41:36,220 --> 00:41:36,660
Yan Shang.

657
00:41:39,060 --> 00:41:40,300
Come back to Sheng'an with me.

658
00:41:49,620 --> 00:41:50,100
Your Highness.

659
00:41:53,500 --> 00:41:53,980
I...

660
00:42:00,060 --> 00:42:00,540
Yan Shang!

661
00:42:01,220 --> 00:42:01,940
Yan Shang, what's wrong?

662
00:42:02,420 --> 00:42:02,780
Yan Shang!

663
00:42:05,620 --> 00:42:06,060
Yan Shang!

664
00:42:07,140 --> 00:42:07,620
Yan Shang!

665
00:42:11,220 --> 00:42:11,700
Yan Shang!

666
00:43:56,820 --> 00:43:57,260
Your Highness.

667
00:43:59,860 --> 00:44:00,620
Tonight,

668
00:44:03,900 --> 00:44:04,940
you look truly beautiful.

669
00:44:08,380 --> 00:44:08,980
Yan Shang.

670
00:44:11,620 --> 00:44:12,940
You really are impossible!

671
00:44:15,100 --> 00:44:15,660
I'm sorry.

672
00:44:19,740 --> 00:44:21,380
I've kept you heartbroken for so long.

673
00:44:49,820 --> 00:44:53,260
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

674
00:44:53,500 --> 00:44:56,940
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

675
00:44:57,060 --> 00:45:03,980
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

676
00:45:04,140 --> 00:45:06,020
♪- May time be free of fear;
- Boats rock♪

677
00:45:06,020 --> 00:45:08,660
♪- Lights fade, seasons turn;
- May time be free of pain♪

678
00:45:08,780 --> 00:45:11,300
♪You're the only one I need♪

679
00:45:11,380 --> 00:45:15,000
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

680
00:45:15,000 --> 00:45:18,540
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

681
00:45:18,580 --> 00:45:21,980
♪- Till fireworks flood the town;
- Till the lake is still and clear♪

682
00:45:22,020 --> 00:45:24,900
♪The wind blows past us♪

683
00:45:41,820 --> 00:45:46,540
♪- If there's still;
- Some warmth left in this world♪

684
00:45:47,180 --> 00:45:50,740
♪You're the only one I need♪

685
00:45:52,620 --> 00:45:57,420
