686
00:45:57,420 --> 00:45:58,380
I've never mistaken anyone.

687
00:45:58,740 --> 00:45:59,860
That is Magistrate Yan.

688
00:45:59,860 --> 00:46:00,900
Don't let them hear you.

689
00:46:01,100 --> 00:46:02,780
When we cook porridge for them later,

690
00:46:02,980 --> 00:46:03,540
