695
00:46:14,201 --> 00:46:17,494
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

696
00:46:20,179 --> 00:46:25,095
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

697
00:46:27,289 --> 00:46:33,134
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

698
00:46:33,634 --> 00:46:38,860
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

699
00:46:41,629 --> 00:46:46,420
