plunge into hellfire as one♪

702
00:46:58,286 --> 00:46:59,934
♪Burning bright as a song♪

703
00:46:59,986 --> 00:47:03,710
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

704
00:47:04,088 --> 00:47:08,754
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

705
00:47:09,373 --> 00:47:13,414
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

706
00:47:13,905 --> 00:47:16,020
