707
00:47:16,060 --> 00:47:23,006
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

708
00:47:23,769 --> 00:47:27,222
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

709
00:47:27,402 --> 00:47:30,547
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

710
00:47:30,986 --> 00:47:37,623
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

711
